    "description": "### Impact\r\nOn multisite clusters, some disk caches are shared by all sites. An admin of one site can make another site serve content they control, including theme JavaScript. Single-site installs are not affected.\r\n\r\n### Workarounds\r\nNone.\n\nDiscovered by Anthropic's OSS Scanner, as vulnerabilities ANT-2026-Z77B3W8H and ANT-2026-JXSIZFSU.",
